# Build-context hygiene: the daemon receives everything not listed here
# (deploy/Dockerfile.server only COPYs specific paths, but the whole context
# is uploaded first). Keep local state, secrets and caches out of it —
# especially .env, which holds the operator's master key.
.git
.env
.github
.agents
.dsh
.mem
.zcode
data/
dist/
docs/
*.md
LICENSE
agent
agent.exe
server
fobe-server
fobe-agent
web/node_modules/
web/dist/
